{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow","id":939031,"title":"[IC] [Mage: the Awakening 2E] Mountains of Shadow","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-28T12:28:14-07:00","id":939031,"title":"[IC] [Mage: the Awakening 2E] Mountains of Shadow","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><u>Mountains of Shadow</u></b></span><br /> <br /> The Rocky Mountains and their rural countryside provide a distinct contrast to the growing urbanization around Denver, Colorado. This duality is reflected in the Fallen World, but in many places along the Rockies, the Gauntlet is so razor thin -- or even absent -- that the Shadow and its spirit denizens bleed into the realm of mortals. In and around the Denver metropolitan area, odd fluctuations in the Gauntlet lead to frequent and temporary Irises, and this grand Mystery has been the source of study for quite some time.<br /> <br /> Some Mystagogues claim that these Irises open up not at random times or places, but somehow in response to other events in the region. Thearchs claim that these Irises may be used to their advantage to encourage Awakening among Sleepers. Many mages, regardless of their Order or Path, Obsess over their ability to gain power and influence in the region through their interaction with the Shadow.<br /> <br /> But mages aren't the only supernatural beings with a claim to the Shadow. The Uratha, or werewolves, claim this realm as their birthright and defend its natural order with tooth and nail. Some werewolves and mages create alliances, usually grudgingly or temporarily, and set aside their differences to stop a spirit invasion. Others are outright hostile and will attack other supernatural beings on sight. But many of the rest are cautious, choosing to study the other warily before creating unnecessary risk by inviting retaliation.<br /> <br /> In a city where danger can strike and Mysteries can be found at any time, across multiple realms, who's to say what's safe?<br /> <br /> <b>Current Player Characters</b><br /> 1. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8136_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8136\" data-vbnamecard=\"8136\">rwknoll</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1128616#post1128616\">Bruiser</a> (Thyrsus Arrow), U.S. Army Veteran on a journey of personal and spiritual discovery<br /> 2. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar600_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"600\" data-vbnamecard=\"600\">HaplessWithDice</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1127462#post1127462\">Death Wolf</a> (Moros Arrow), Awakened black sheep in a family of werewolves<br /> 3. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12802_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12802\" data-vbnamecard=\"12802\">Hardwire99</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1124051#post1124051\">Bad Dawg</a> (Obrimos Guardian), private detective seeking redemption<br /> 4. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5241\" data-vbnamecard=\"5241\">Flinty</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1124905#post1124905\">Marduk</a> (Mastigos th\u00e9arch), lawyer literally trying to overcome his demons<br /> 5. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7592\" data-vbnamecard=\"7592\">wtaylorjr2001</a> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=924858#post924858\">Dr. Luck</a> (Acanthus Mystagogue), author making a comeback<br /> <br /> ----------------<br /> <br /> <u><b>Table of Contents</b></u><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\">OOC Thread</a><br /> <br /> <b>(Old group - Game no longer active)</b><br /> Prologue: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=939034#post939034\">&quot;Ignorance is Bliss&quot;</a><br /> Chapter 1: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=939035#post939035\">&quot;Howl in the Night&quot;</a><br /> <br /> ------<br /> <br /> <b>Chasing Your Shadow</b><br /> Prologue: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1123822#post1123822\">&quot;The Watch Dogs&quot;</a><br /> Chapter 1: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1140070#post1140070\">&quot;Quis Custodiet Ipsos Custodes?&quot;</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-13-2017, 11:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T12:28:47-07:00","id":939032,"title":"","content":"<b><u>List of Supporting Characters</u> </b>(grouped by relationship)<br /> <br /> <b>Sleepers and Unknown</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1123822#post1123822\">Sally McCann</a>: 7-year-old girl, daughter of Jill McCann (Sleepwalker retainer).<br /> <br /> <b>Sleepwalkers</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1123822#post1123822\">Jill McCann</a>: Retainer for the Silver Ladder.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Mages</u></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=1123822#post1123822\">Victory</a>: Acanthus th\u00e9arch. Colleague and acquaintance of Marduk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 09-13-2017, 11:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T12:29:30-07:00","id":939034,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Prologue: \u201cIgnorance is Bliss\u201d</b></span><br /> <br /> You have Awakened.<br /> <br /> The past few weeks have been the most bizarre, but probably the most intensely rewarding, of your lives. It\u2019s not just because the actual experience of Awakening is incredibly strange but inspiring for each mage who survives the process. Since having your eyes opened to the Lie that you have always known, you\u2019ve learned an all-important truth.<br /> <br /> Ignorance is bliss \u2013 but so is <i>power</i>.<br /> <br /> For many newly Awakened mages, learning the extent \u2013 and limits \u2013 of your new power often results in a fair bit of stumbling. You have experimented, tested, and pushed your fledgling control, and in doing so, have learned some of the basics of willworking. It can be a messy process, and even lethal for some, especially in Denver. Through your experimentation, for different reasons and in different ways, you were fortunate enough to stumble across the path of another mage. They found you, realized the implications of being the first to find you, and quickly introduced you to a whole society of other mages living right there in your own community.<br /> <br /> Awakening tends to happen in spurts; in your case, the four of you all gained your new magical abilities within a few days of each other, and found your way to other mages after the first week. Through some twist of fate \u2013 or perhaps Fate? It\u2019s never easy to tell with these folks \u2013 you were each discovered by a member of The Band.<br /> <br /> The Band is a cabal of five mages who have chosen their cabal and Shadow Names around the central theme of music, using it as a metaphor and symbol of how they choose to weave their magic in this world. The Band shepherded you together and explained the critical social nature of a Denverite mage\u2019s reality: Thrive in numbers, or die in isolation.<br /> <br /> First, you learned about the Orders. Each of you reflected on your calling, your values, and your goals. You were approached by several different mages of the Pentacle Orders, eager to recruit new mages to further their own agendas. Eventually, you found the one that best suited you, and you completed your first true rite of passage by completing the initiation tasks set by each Order.<br /> <br /> For the Council of Free Assemblies, or the Free Council, this process was quite straightforward. You were invited for an interview with several of the leading members and asked a series of seemingly simple questions: Who are you? Why do you wish to join the Free Council? Where do you see yourself in five years? And so on. After hearing your responses, in the spirit of democracy, they voted on whether to admit you to their Order. In your case, they said yes.<br /> <br /> The Mysterium, on the other hand, uses a layered initiation. Your first task, to gain entry into the Order and access to the most basic information stored in their Athenaea, was also simple: Share a piece of knowledge you gained from your Awakening. The Order leader who initiated you pressed you for knowledge, challenged what you shared, and ultimately decided that you had the necessary qualities to partake in \u2013 and contribute to \u2013 their collective knowledge. Further levels of initiation, they explained, would come with time when they deemed you ready.<br /> <br /> With your Order as your new home, you were thrown into studies, drilled on the basics of Paradox, mana, High Speech, and other vital pieces of occult knowledge. Members of The Band who served in your Order brought you under their wing and instructed you. For each of you, this process emphasized basic knowledge about the greater Mysteries of Denver, and the tension between mages and the Uratha, the werewolves. Learning that information, that werewolves and other things really <i>do</i> go bump in the night, affects everyone differently. For most, though, seeing pictures of other mages who have literally been ripped to pieces is a pretty sobering and humbling experience.<br /> <br /> After learning these basic skills, your mentors instructed you to form a cabal. Seek out other newly Awakened mages, they explained, and form a group that will become your new family. Pick people you feel like you can trust, they told you, because few other bonds in this world are stronger and tighter than those of a cabal. And so you found each other. You\u2019ve only just met each other, although some of you think you\u2019ve crossed paths before in your life. Was that a twist of fate, too, or a Supernal calling?<br /> <br /> Now that you are ready \u2013 at least in your mentors\u2019 eyes \u2013 to take off your training wheels, you\u2019ve been called together by The Band with a request for your aid...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Formatting 07-28-2016, 03:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T12:30:37-07:00","id":939035,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Chapter 1: \u201cHowl in the Night\u201d</b></span><br /> <i>Saturday, September 3, 2016. Mid-afternoon.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Spider and Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> You are in downtown Denver, just about to walk into a meeting with your Order mentor. Melody, a bubbly and amicable African American woman probably in her late-30\u2019s, is an Obrimos Libertine. She works as a researcher in the Department of Physics at the University of Colorado-Denver. Melody has tried to make herself as available as possible to answer any questions you might have, and she is always downright pleasant and approachable when seeing her in person. However, she does have this tendency to take a while to get back to your texts or calls unless it\u2019s an emergency. When she contacts you, though, she expects a prompt response. Any time you\u2019ve been slow to get back to her, she politely asks you at length what took so long, and comments on the fact that she\u2019s <i>really </i>busy.<br /> <br /> You aren\u2019t sure what the urgency is about this time, but she asked you to come to campus on a short notice, and requested that you meet her in her office in the academic building. The two of you meet up outside. It\u2019s a bright, sunny day, and campus is pretty busy with students and faculty roaming about the streets nearby.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Luck and Simurgh</b><br /> You\u2019ve been called to a meeting with your Order mentor. Upon initiation, you received a special guest pass that can be used to take a special elevator to a lower level of the Denver Central Library. The passes are only given out to Mystagogues or mages invited as special guests to Order events; the elevator itself is under constant sympathetic surveillance to ensure privacy.<br /> <br /> You\u2019re heading down the hallway to the private office of Cadence. He is a middle-aged Caucasian man in his late 40s or early 50s. He\u2019s generally a pretty nice guy and has been a treasure trove of knowledge. He has this tendency to get off track when he is very excited about something, which is endearing but means it takes forever for you to get a word in edgewise when he\u2019s on a roll.<br /> <br /> The two of you meet just after getting off the elevator. Cadence has made it clear that you\u2019re welcome to discuss anything related to Awakened society or magic that you need to once you get off the elevator or anywhere on the lower level, although he has encouraged you to speak about Mysteries and cabal matters in private.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T13:22:44-07:00","id":939077,"title":"","content":"<b>Spider</b><br /> <br /> Spider has settled into a short skirt and sunny top for the pleasant day and offers Ouroboros Ophis her usual cheery smile of greeting, her ever present smart phone tucked into one of her t-shirt's pockets and attached to the small earpiece in her ear by means of a white wire. &quot;Well, hi there. Seems I'm not the only one being called to the principal's office. You've any idea what we're in for?&quot; Even as she speaks she glances about thoughtfully, fingering her phone &quot;Shouldn't risk taking too long, right? We'd only get scolded. 'sides, I'm all sorts of curious on what she's after.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T15:03:19-07:00","id":939164,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 Day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Morning Ritual: Casting <i>Supress Aura </i>(Death 2)<br /> 1 Free Reach to use Advanced Duration (1 Day)<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422993\" target=\"_blank\"> 2 Successes!</a></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Good morning, dear.&quot; He answers in return with a gentle nod of the head. &quot;I am every bit as curious as you about what our beloved Melody could require of us, alas, no idea&quot; He procures an old style pocket watch from his grey vest and after taking a quick look at the hour nods again in agreement. &quot;Yes, yes. Better not have her waiting. Ladies first, dear&quot; He smiles and gently waves his arm indicating that both of you should get going.<br /> <br /> As you walk through the corridors, some students greet both of you in passing. &quot;So&quot; He says &quot;Have you done any interesting research lately?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 07-29-2016, 03:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-28T23:18:29-07:00","id":939372,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> The Obrimos smiles wryly, setting out on he directed course and weaving through students with an ease speaking of a fair amount of practice.&quot;She does get grouchy..&quot; Spider muses. &quot;As for research, hm. I tried a new baseline code, self teaching. Effectively, you give a program a goal and see if it can get there. Right now, it's just making words, but it's a very basic first step. Left it running so will see how it is when I'm back home. How are you coping with your many students?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Casting <i>Wards and Signs</i> (Prime 2) (Prior to scene)<br /> 1 Free Reach; Spending for advanced duration.<br /> Base pool of 3. +1 (Dedicated tool) +2 (High Speech), +3 (Willpower point), +1 (One ritual interval), -4 (+1 potency)=6 dice<a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/422976\" target=\"_blank\">Failure </a></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2650,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","user":"Retias","date":". 07-29-2016, 01:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T03:53:41-07:00","id":939430,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;That sounds quite interesting, dear!&quot; He compliments you with sincere admiration. &quot;I am doing quite fine, actually, thanks for asking. I must admit I expected more problems adapting from practice to teaching, but it is a refreshing change&quot;. He pauses for a moment, as wondering if sharing or not. &quot;I, for my part, am planning of following a pregnacy, from conception to delivery to determine the point when the soul sets in&quot; *coughs* &quot;I am very excited, I could have never imagine I could actually observe such a thing&quot;.<br /> <br /> As you continue with iddle conversation you finally arrive at Melody's office.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 07-29-2016, 03:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T09:01:24-07:00","id":939565,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>OOOOOOO</b> | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <div align=\"left\"><br /> <br /> As was his habit, Dr Luck woke at five in the morning. He exercised for an hour after an invigorating breakfast in the old rickety building he called his home. He just bought it using a downpayment he got for his first, and also only book that went bestseller in the new york times. The house was old and needed repairs, just like his car. But a pen stab on an old map told him to leave his apt in New York City and buy a home in the suburbs of Denver Colorado.<br /> <br /> His stomach was still bandaged from the gunshot would so he had to take it easy, but he needed the excercise. Magic was slowly building up within his soul. He called it elaborate wishing. He could work some magic, and he was filled with magic power, just not as much experience as the disciples as they were known in the Mysterium.<br /> <br /> When he was done excercising he spent the next hour practicing magic. He cast a divination ritual. It was an hour long ritual that would give him information about his future. He wanted the answer to the question, will I get into a lethal fight today? This was time magic. He was not as good with Time as with Fate.<br /> <br /> He took out his silver topped walking cane and holding it out, turned in a circle. He chanted in the language that spells used. He went on to complete the ritual. It takes two hours to get it right.<br /> <br /> When he was done and had the answer he checked his wallet for the card granting entry to the Mysterium safe house in the library. He went to the library in his old Volkswagon beetle. He loved the car but it constantly broke down.<br /> <br /> He arrived at the library fifteen minutes early. He saw Simurgh and greeted him.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:red\">&quot;Hi Simurgh, I hope you are doing well this morning. Have you any idea what the meeting is about?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Casting Divination in the morning. Will I get into a lethal fight today?<br /> He used his dedicated took, the silvered walking stick, and high speech. This is a praxis.<br /> 8d10o10h7 this is the roll I used, please tell me if it was right or wrong.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423024\" target=\"_blank\">Divination of the day</a>: <u>7d10o10h8</u> <b>0</b><br /> Should be 8 dice.<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423025\" target=\"_blank\">Divination of the day</a>: <u>8d10o10h8</u> <b>3</b><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 07-29-2016, 04:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T13:05:54-07:00","id":939729,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:green\"><b>Simurgh</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Shadow Walk: duration until late morning 10 September 2016<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Morning Ritual: casting Shadow Walk. 1 Free Reach for advanced Duration<br /> Gnosis 1 + Spirit 2 + High Speech 2 + Path tool 1 (stream water in a copper bowl) + WP 3 - bumping Duration 2 = 7d10o10h8!<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423043\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Simurgh spends the time after breakfast to cast a ritual that should hide him from unwanted notice for a week, chanting in High Speech and focusing on his reflection in a copper cup filled with previously bottled stream water.<br /> <br /> After shortly eathing again, he answers the phone and drives to the museum, meeting Dr. Luck in the elevator.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;Probably some Iris got opened somewhere.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":6508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","user":"Tambov","date":".  Bowl, not cup 07-29-2016, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T13:19:54-07:00","id":939738,"title":"","content":"<b>Spider and Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> After making your way through campus and chatting with each other, you arrive at Melody's office, the door to which is propped open.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.blackwomenswellnessday.org/resources/bw1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Melody doesn't notice you right away. Her medium-length hair is pulled into a ponytail, and she's chewing on the end of a pencil while she stares at some report in front of her -- probably an academic journal, if you had to guess. Her office is cluttered, with papers scattered around her desk, sticky notes posted on the desk and her computer monitor, and a few books lying in a stack beside her.<br /> <br /> As you enter the room, she looks up, blinks, and then smiles broadly as she realizes who you are. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800080\">Oh, you made it! I was starting to wonder if you got my text. Please, please, come in.</span>&quot; Melody's singsong voice sounds as chipper as usual today. She motions to two standard office chairs sitting across from her desk. She glances out into the hallway, closes the door, and takes a seat.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#800080\">How have things been going for you both?</span>&quot; she asks eagerly. &quot;<span style=\"color:#800080\">Anything exciting lately?&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T13:43:15-07:00","id":939760,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> &quot;Hi there Melody.&quot; Spider smiles broadly, looking around the office and letting herself sprawl with a certain lack of dignity on a chair as she gets comfortable. The Machine chatters in her ear and shifts within the phone, tempted by the near computer. Spider decides against unleashing it, however. Al it'd likely end up doing is annoying Melody and she's not after a big argurement right now. She does let her gaze sweep the office however, checking out various books curiously before her eyes go back to their host. &quot;I left a self coding program running.&quot; She says with a grin. &quot;Either it's figured out how to type &quot;Hello World&quot; or it's turned into Skynet. I'll find out soon.&quot;<br /> <br /> Root rubs her fingers together. &quot;You've been a little restless, Mel?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2650,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","user":"Retias","date":". 07-30-2016, 03:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T14:54:32-07:00","id":939800,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Melody</span>&quot; He nods, entering the messy office and taking one of the seats after Spider sits down herself. &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Doesn't it sound incredible?</span>&quot; comments after his cabalmate explains her latest experiment &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">I cannot wait to see its progress. Imagine if we could teach it morals? The possibilities...</span>&quot; *coughs* &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Sorry, I digress. What can we do for you today, dear? Has there been any problems?</span>&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-29T21:23:39-07:00","id":939946,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Luck</b><br /> With adrenaline still pumping through your body from your vigorous workout, you find the first hour of magical practice to be difficult. You do everything right, as you've been trained, but your High Speech is just a little off, and you struggle to form your Imago. Not one to give up easily, you attempt again in earnest, and this time the words roll off your tongue with ease. <br /> <br /> The divination ritual grants you a tiny glimpse of the future in vague, moving swirls of color surrounding the briefest flashes of clarity. After a pause, a voiceless sensation fills you: <i>No.</i> And yet...you can't help but feel like the answer is less firm than usual, somehow. What does that mean?<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You technically can ask 1 more question because you have potency 2, due to your Time 2 arcanum. Because you didn't reach for more thorough responses, this is all you get. <br /> <br /> Because it's an exceptional success, you choose one of the bonuses on p. 115. The most relevant is probably 1 bonus potency (so you can ask a third question for free), or gain a positive condition that can help you and give an Arcane Feat.<br /> <br /> Feel free to have any conversation you like between you and Simurgh before moving on.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Spider and Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Wow!&quot;</span> Melody's reaction of admiration is genuine, evident from the beaming smile on her face. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;I have to say, that's pretty ambitious for someone so new to...&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Melody trails off and looks vexed as she studies the door. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Sorry, but I just always feel so paranoid when I'm talking about <i>those</i> kind of things without complete privacy,&quot;</span> she explains. <br /> <br /> Melody's eyes narrow briefly; suddenly, both of your peripheral senses cause you to feel a strange sense of something supernatural happening in the room. When Melody speaks again, the room sounds quieter somehow. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;There. That should keep all of the sound completely here between us.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Melody sighs. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;I asked you to come here because I have a favor to ask. And I'm sorry in advance because I know how boring and tedious it will be, but I am just <i>swamped</i> here with work.&quot;</span> She sighs again, more heavily this time. <br /> <br /> Melody begins to explain about her favor. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;There is a Sleepwalker who works for me -- well, technically for the Order, but she's a personal friend of mine -- named Jill McCann. She's been working on a project that includes collecting info about some spirit-related issues that I'm sure someone else in The Band could tell you more about -- Cadence will talk your ear off if you let him, trust me, and I just don't have time for it. But basically, I need you to pick up some documents and bring them to our next meeting. <br /> <br /> &quot;The reason she hasn't been able to just do it herself,&quot;</span> Melody continues, <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;is because she's been having some weird things happen at her house. Seems benign, but I haven't had a chance to stop by and check it out, so we're not sure if it's spirits, a ghost, or what. We assume spirits, because she lives about half an hour west of here closer to the countryside. Cadence and I were wondering if your new cabal could go, check out what's going on at her home, maybe 'tidy up' the place, and grab that research.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Melody looks between you two with an apologetic but hopeful smile. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;So what do you think? It'd be a huge help.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 07-30-2016, 12:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T01:45:09-07:00","id":940002,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Active Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I started dabbling before Waking up.&quot;</span> Spider mused, speaking up after Melody shielded the room from potential evasdroppers. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I'm carrying on now, because it can show that even in the Fallen, Magic exists. A being of energy and light that's intangible and still exists. What could speak more of Magic then that?&quot;</span> She smiled broadly, looking around the room. Curiousity took over and she blinked slowly. She was fairly sure she know what spell Melody had made use of, as it's one she would have herself, but she still had the desire to see it. And so she let active sight filter into her awareness, holding the pose for the short duration her weak Gnosis allowed as the spell and currents of both Fallen and Supernal energy in the room intruded on her perception.<br /> <br /> She nodded at Melody's request, rubbing her mouth. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;When did you last hear from her? Spirits or ghosts, well, we'd have Simurgh and Ophis here along for the ride, whichever it turns out to be.&quot;</span> She grinned at her cabal mate. As for Jill, she felt a twinge of worry. It was possible she was in more trouble then Melody seemed to consider her to be.<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> &quot;What's her address?&quot; </span>She asked, deciding to ask The Machine to go and take an advanced scout.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T03:37:14-07:00","id":940031,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>A bein of energy and light that's intagible and still exists... That sounds like the very description of an angel</i></span>&quot; He thought, listening to the two women. &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">I have some classes this morning, but we can all meet there in the afternoon to deal with whatever it is that is bothering your associate</span>&quot; He added after his cabalmate agreed to the task &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">I have little experience with ghosts, but I am eager to learn as much as I can if the oportunity presents itself. At the very least, I should be able to allow all of us to see them and maybe offer some degree of protection</span>&quot; he pauses &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">And if bad gets to worse, I am positive I can undone almost any harm we suffer. Hopefully it will not get there</span>&quot;.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T09:04:53-07:00","id":940102,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> <br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>OOOOOOO</b> | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 <br /> <b>Conditions:</b>None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> <br /> When Dr Luck cast the Divination spell the second time he succeeded so well he could feel the space for an additional question. The no felt incomplete. There was something more that the spell was trying to tell him. He wish he had used some of the more advanced methods, but he didn't quite feel up to that task, so the questions gave more limited answers. He questioned Time twice more. Will I get into a non lethal fight today? He could feel the walls of time pressing against his mind as he pushed you yet another question, a third question. Will I fight a non human entity today?<br /> <br /> This was too much, he was not good with thousand question games. He would cast the spell again. This time he would use one of the advanced features of the spell. He would instant cast a version of the spell that gave better details. Two advanced features, he had never done that before. He was nervous.<br /> <br /> He took his silver capped cane and held it out. He turned around making an invisible circle in the air. He spoke High Speech, the language of magic. The only difference between the full ritual and instant casting were the advanced routines. He used them. <br /> <br /> He asked the same question, will I get into a fight today with lethal weapons use against me?<br /> <br /> When the morning rituals were done, and he went to the central library, he spoke to Simurgh.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I don't know what is going on but I hope its not that. It would not be good for us to have creatures coming in through an Iris opened. An Iris is like a gate to another world right. I am having a brain fart now.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Divination 2 reaches, instant cast and gain better informationed answers.<br /> Time + Gnosis + Dedicated Tools + High Speech = 8 Dice<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423214\" target=\"_blank\">Divination of the day Instant Cast</a>: <u>8d10o10h8</u> <b>3</b><br /> Another exceptional success with another increase in Potency for 3 questions. (Where does it say that arcana level is potency? I can't find it. I am still learning the rules <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Will I get into a fight today where lethal weapons will be brought agains me?<br /> Will I meet a non human entity today?<br /> Will there be an opportunity to learn about non human entities today?<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T10:08:09-07:00","id":940128,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:green\"><b>Simurgh</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Shadow Walk: duration until late morning 10 September 2016, CW +2 (5)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;Ususally more like another plane of the same world, but yes. That's the spirit of it. Or it could be to another place on the same plane, to Tokio for example. But here, it's likely there's another Shadow Gate opened. Luckily I can offer protection against Spirits if we have to fight them.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He frowns, remembering something.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;Luck, there's something I've been meaning to tell you. Do you remember how Cabals harmonize their Shadow Names between each other, to streighten their power?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We're likely going to be together with Spider and Ophis.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;A spider weaving her web. A snake biting his own tail. A winged dog of pure magic. Do you see the pattern?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm just saying, if you'd rename yourself something like Brer Rabbit or that Chinese lucky bat or something, we're all be getting stronger magically for this, you including.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Using logic to persuade Luck, rolling if neccessary: Int 3 + Expression 1 + Status 1 - Resolve 2 = 3d10o10h8! <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423216\" target=\"_blank\">0 successes</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":6508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","user":"Tambov","date":".  typo 07-30-2016, 01:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T14:56:18-07:00","id":940270,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>OOOOOOO</b> | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I appreciate the fact that you don't like my name, but I do. I like the name Dr Luck because it was given to me by a cute little girl who tried to cross the street when the light was red. She was almost hit when I rescued her by grabbing her and weaving until we got to the other side. She said I was the luckiest guy alive and started calling me Dr Luck. I liked the name so it stuck. I know about the synergy possibility and we can work together to form something, but I am not changing my name.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Luck was annoyed with Simurgh but he tried to see the issue from Simurgh's side. He would have to find a way to unite Simurgh, Luck, Orphis and Spider.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I will look into the matter, perhaps we can find different commonality, maybe I could be the world's luckiest man, but I will keep the name Dr Luck&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 07-30-2016, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T05:06:42-07:00","id":940579,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:green\"><b>Simurgh</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Shadow Walk: duration until late morning 10 September 2016, CW +2 (5)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;It's not that I don't like it, but... fine. Guess we'll have to grow into our names each on his own. Or her own, in Spider's case.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh by the way, how about we all go watch 101 Dalmatians once we're done?&quot;</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T09:10:18-07:00","id":940642,"title":"","content":"<b>Spider</b><br /> Melody nods at your questions. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Thank you so much for the help! It's probably been, oh, maybe a few days since I last heard from her? She texted me but I haven't had a chance to reply yet. I'm working on a manuscript revision for a study I'm wrapping up with a colleague. Some mages think carrying on academia after Awakening is a waste of time, but we Libertines can appreciate the integration of magic and humanity, right?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Melody jotted down the address on a piece of paper. <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;When you see her, tell her I'm still hoping to meet up sometime for lunch if she can find a babysitter for Sally on a weekend. She has this <i>adorable</i> little 7-year-old girl.&quot;</span> <br /> <br /> As you open your Sight, you admire Melody's spell. You can actually see the sound waves move through the air, but they're moving solely in a tunnel between you, Ophis, and Melody. You could attempt to Reveal more information or Scrutinize her spell, if you wish. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">If you attempt to learn more about the spell, you can do so using Focused Mage Sight rules on p. 92-93. Opacity is 2.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> Melody turns to you and adds, <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;I hardly think Perfecting spells will be needed. Sally can be a little energetic sometimes, but she's harmless,&quot;</span> Melody jokes. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">&quot;Have a good time. And feel free to text or call if you need anything. I'll try to keep an eye on my phone.&quot;</span> Melody turns back to her manuscript and starts reading without much of a pause. You know from experience that she would gladly answer more questions, but once she gets absorbed in a project, she can be pretty focused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T09:25:33-07:00","id":940650,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Luck</b><br /> <i>Earlier that morning...</i><br /> You reach out with your will and force your Imago into place. You receive glimpses of the day in flashes of clarity, and a voiceless sense gives the answers you seek. <br /> <br /> <i>No one will fight you with potentially lethal weapons today.</i> A flash of color shifts, and you see a small but ominous creature with vague features. <i>You will be in the presence of a non-human entity, and you will likely interact with it and learn from it.</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'll try to put up the next section with Cadence today. Busy with packing. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T10:44:17-07:00","id":940690,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>OOOOOOO</b> | <b>WP:</b> 5/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I am writing a book, an urban fantasy book that I need to research. It is about a mage that is just learning his craft. While I would rather see 101 dalmations, I can't. I will be writing. Don't worry, it is not going to reveal any secrets about us.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck continued down in the elevator. He thought back to his divination this morning. He would meet and learn from a non human entity. This was getting exciting. A real non human entity. He wondered what he would run into. An alien, a vampire, a spirit, a fae creature all of these were conceivable.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;This morning I cast a practice ritual and I learned that I will be meeting a non human entity today. Maybe that is what Cadence called us in for. We will probably not be fighting for our lives today. I won't at least.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 07-31-2016, 01:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T10:45:24-07:00","id":940691,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Will be sure to do that.</span>&quot; Spider nods contently, tapping the address into her phone, along with a request to the Machine to scout ahead and take a quick look as she lets her Mage Sight fade. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I'm terrible with kids, but hope I don't terrify the girl too much.&quot;</span> She smiles wryly. &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">As for magic and humanity.. all humans have souls and a tie to the Supernal. Truth can be found in many places. That' what the Pentacle tends to miss spotting at times.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> She looks over to Ouroboros Ophis. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Ready when you are. Get in touch with the other two and prep to head out?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T13:39:51-07:00","id":940817,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Luck and Simurgh</b><br /> As you finish your conversation, you arrive at Cadence's office. The door is closed, but he has told you before that you're always welcome to knock, and that he will answer if he isn't busy.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.wholehealthinsider.com/wp-content/uploads/Middle-aged-man.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> A middle-aged Caucasian man opens the door with a smile. He has gray hair that's partially balding, but he has an energetic step. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Ah, you made it! Please, come in.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The Acanthus Mystagogue invites you each to sit in a padded leather chair. His office has a large, wide bookshelf that stretches to the ceiling and is filled with a mix of mundane and occult books on a range of topics. Various pictures hang on the wall of exotic locations he has visited, all with him grinning excitedly and pointing to different things he finds interesting.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;I hope your studies have been going well. I have a very important task for you both that I think will serve our Order well. But first, have you been learning anything or studying anything interesting of note?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> After he gives you each a chance to share about your recent studies, Cadence begins to explain his request. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;It started with this woman Melody knows, a Sleepwalker retainer of hers...I think her name is Jill? Anyway, Melody mentioned in passing that Jill has been having some odd occurrences at her home recently. From the sounds of it, Jill has been seeing odd marks around their home, almost like animal tracks, but unlike anything she's ever seen. From the information I've been able to gather, it also sounds like Sally -- that's her young daughter -- has reported seeing things at night near the house.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Cadence begins to speak eagerly, mirroring the excitement on his face from the many pictures around his office. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;The Mysterium has a number of mages who collect information about spirits and other supernatural creatures, especially the ones that interact with Sleepers. But few of them are able to, or choose to, manifest themselves in such a way that they're visible to the naked eye. If Sally has seen them, she might have a special kind of talent that allows her to detect supernatural creatures, which would be <i>fascinating</i> to study. Or, alternatively, these creatures may have interesting properties worth studying.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know a few Mystagogues who have been trying to catalogue spirit-related activity all around Denver. If you could contribute to their research, not only would it be a good opportunity for you to learn more about spirits for yourselves, but it could help you to build some relationships within the Order,&quot;</span> Cadence explains. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;I'd like you to go and investigate. I believe Melody has asked Spider and Ouroboros Ophis to go as well, to pick up some paperwork or something that Jill needed to pass on to the Free Council. But your presence would certainly be helpful to them.&quot;</span> Cadence smiles again. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Do make sure you check on the girl, too. Try and ask her about what she's seen, but more importantly, <i>how</i> she has seen what she has. It might be quite enlightening.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Added next part of conversation re: task 08-01-2016, 11:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T13:51:47-07:00","id":940830,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Of course, dear</span>&quot; He gets up &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">We will contact you as soon as we have the documents and make sure everything is fine with Ms. McCann's home</span>&quot; says to Melody as farewell, conscient that she may not longer be listening. &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Spider, dear, could you call our two young boys and arrange the meeting? I have some work left to do here, but we can, perhaps, have lunch together before going on our asigment</span>&quot; He makes a gentle bow and opens the door, waiting for his cabalmate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T11:27:18-07:00","id":941287,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:green\"><b>Simurgh</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Shadow Walk: duration until late morning 10 September 2016, CW +2 (5)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;I hope your studies have been going well. I have a very important task for you both that I think will serve our Order well. But first, have you been learning anything or studying anything interesting of note?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;Rebounds-on-Ground has developed some powers over frogs. In particular, it no longer needs a sprinkler or magical help to stay in its body.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;It started with this woman Melody knows, a Sleepwalker retainer of hers...I think her name is Jill? Anyway, Melody mentioned in passing that Jill has been having some odd occurrences at her home recently. From the sounds of it, Jill has been seeing odd marks around their home, almost like animal tracks, but unlike anything she's ever seen. From the information I've been able to gather, it also sounds like Sally -- that's her young daughter -- has reported seeing things at night near the house.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;The Mysterium has a number of mages who collect information about spirits and other supernatural creatures, especially the ones that interact with Sleepers. But few of them are able to, or choose to, manifest themselves in such a way that they're visible to the naked eye. If Sally has seen them, she might have a special kind of talent that allows her to detect supernatural creatures, which would be <i>fascinating</i> to study. Or, alternatively, these creatures may have interesting properties worth studying.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know a few Mystagogues who have been trying to catalogue spirit-related activity all around Denver. If you could contribute to their research, not only would it be a good opportunity for you to learn more about spirits for yourselves, but it could help you to build some relationships within the Order,&quot;</span> Cadence explains. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;I'd like you to go and investigate. I believe Melody has asked Spider and Ouroboros Ophis to go as well, to pick up some paperwork or something that Jill needed to pass on to the Free Council. But your presence would certainly be helpful to them.&quot;</span> Cadence smiles again. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Do make sure you check on the girl, too. Try and ask her about what she's seen, but more importantly, <i>how</i> she has seen what she has. It might be quite enlightening.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;Check on the girl, find out if she has any talent for seeing Spirits, check on the Spirit or whatever it is. Got it.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T13:32:40-07:00","id":941371,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> <br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>OOOOOOO</b> | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 <br /> <b>Conditions:</b>None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> OOC<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I made a mistake with willpower, it should be 6 from composure 4 and resolve 2]<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Dr Luck listened to Mr Cadence and told him of his projects.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I have a couple of projects that I am working on. I am first writing a book about a young man who turns into a mage in modern times. It is about how he reacts to it, including his friends and such. I am not writing anything that takes down the veil, I am using an entirely new magic system. I am hoping to learn a lot more about spirits and write up a variant of them. One of the characters is a combat mage who uses the equivalant of Fate magic in battle. Very similar to Hexes, but it works against aliens, vampires, werewolves, spirits, and psychotic violent men and women who carry chainsaws. Then again, hex's do the same thing I believe. I want the book to be good, but not to violate the veil while at the same time I want it to be real enough for people who can awaken, and do awaken, to give them knowledge enough to make it to us. I want to mix Luck or Fate into my book.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck lightly patted his head,<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I almost forgot. Simurgh wanted to find a way to strengthen our ability to work together as a cabal more efficiently by having shadow names all linked together. I was wondering if we could get help with that. I don't want to change my name.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck listened to Cadences response on his book and Simurgh's request and repeated that the book would not break the veil, humanity would not know that mages walked the earth. He also requested, just to be on the safe side that Cadence read the chapters in the book, just to be on the safe side. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T05:52:14-07:00","id":941873,"title":"","content":"<b>Simurgh</b><br /> <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Excellent! I hope that your familiar continues to be a source of assistance for you. Certainly it will be a good opportunity to learn about how spirits interact with each other.&quot;</span> Cadence smiles at your summary. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Yes, yes, that's it. Do be careful, though. Remember, a mage's greatest strengths are preparation and foresight. I remember a time when I was newly Awakened...&quot;</span> Cadence's eyes are unfocused as he starts retelling a tale, at great length, about one of his early experiences with Supernatural beings back before he had much understanding of the way these creatures work and before he had learned to plan ahead for potentially dangerous situations. Fate magic had saved his life, but he seems to describe the harrowing experience with fondness.<br /> <br /> It's a fascinating story. At least, it was the first time he told it to you both. You're pretty sure this is the fourth or fifth time he's shared this pearl of wisdom in as many weeks. It's gotten longer with each retelling, but the details are generally the same.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Luck</b><br /> After Cadence finishes his longwinded story, he turns to you with a considering look. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;You're certainly not the first mage to write about magic after their Awakening. It's an admirable goal, surely, to try and help others Awaken by planting seeds of truth and nourishing them over time. I have a few colleagues in the Silver Ladder who has made that their life ambition. You may even have read some of their work,&quot;</span> he smiles knowingly. Cadence leans forward, a more serious expression on his face. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;But please heed my advice, Dr. Luck. The Mysterium values knowledge, obtained through direct experience. We are responsible for sharing that knowledge when appropriate, or safekeeping it when revealing it may be dangerous or even catastrophic. You cannot lead from a position of ignorance. Write your story when you have time, but you <i>must</i> prioritize seeking actual knowledge. I think you will find that writing about half-truths, rather than seeking <i>new </i>truths, will lose its appeal with time. Perhaps I might be willing to look at your writing sometime in the future, but my availability is limited, and I would rather focus on instructing you about the Myesterium and your Path. As a fellow Acanthus, I believe I have much I could offer you. And I'm sure I can trust you to not violate the Veil,&quot;</span> he frowns.<br /> <br /> Cadence leans back and strokes his chin. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;The idea of creating a cabal theme is certainly an interesting, and beneficial, investment. But it <i>is</i> an investment. It draws not just on your Shadow Names, but on your very magical <i>identities -- </i>who you are at the very core of your being. Most cabals do not meet the necessary requirements to fuel that power. Why, not even Kitpu, our Hierarch here in Denver, has this level of intimacy with his own cabal.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Cadence's voice takes on a gentle lecturing tone as he continues. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;We of The Band made a conscious decision shortly after forming our cabal that we desired this level of connection, and were committed to the task. But we decided our Shadow Names in concert,&quot;</span> he smiles at the pun, <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;and it took considerable time -- months of magical study and dedication -- before we reaped any benefits. Now, looking back, I am indebted to my mentor who urged me to consider this approach with my cabal. But know that it will take effort, by <i>each</i> of you, to reach that level of intimacy.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> The older mage looks to Dr. Luck. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;To be honest, I'm not sure you will be able to develop that group theme if you do not change your Shadow Name, Dr. Luck. I may be wrong. I've read some older manuscripts in our archives that suggest other cabals have managed the benefits without the same commitment to theme that my cabal has. But likely at least one other mage in your cabal would need to change their name, too, or the theme may still be too loose. The good news is that, as fledgling mages, your Shadow Names have not quite settled in so firmly that they cannot be changed with effort. The choice, ultimately, is yours.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Cadence leans back and smiles again. <span style=\"color:brown\">&quot;Well, I've certainly kept you long enough. I'm sure Melody is finished with your colleagues by now. Let me know if you need anything else, and I will stay in touch as my schedule permits.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You can tell from Cadence's responses that he's not inclined to help you with reviewing your book. If you invest in the Mentor merit, he may be more willing and supportive, but it's outside of his interests currently. You can attempt to change that over time using Social Maneuvering, if you like.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 08-02-2016, 09:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T08:51:00-07:00","id":941979,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;Oh I promise that I will extend the Mysterium's knowledge base. I will do research for my book. The research I do will yield information, both for my book, and the Mysterium. I will learn and both myself and the Mysterium will benefit from my work. I do everything possible to me to write from direct experience.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yet beyond just the writing of the book is a magical working on the book. Whoever reads that book is magically effected. A minor blessing. To those who are to awaken, luck will guide them to us. To those who won't awaken, it will be a great read, and mind opening. Like you said it will be a seed, a seed that might grow them into a sleepwalker. Then again it might not, that is the nature of luck.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Simurgh and I will talk to the others in our group about achieving that higher level of synergy. At some point today or tomorrow I would like to read those manuscripts if you don't mind. I would like the names of them please.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> Dr Luck smiles at Cadence and shakes his hand when Cadence indicated the meeting was over. He turns to Simurgh and said,<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;Let's call the others and make sure they all can make a meeting in a few minutes from now.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:red\"><b>Spider and Ou</b></span><span style=\"color:red\"><b>roboros</b></span><br /> <br /> You get a cell phone call from Dr Luck confirming a time and place for a meeting to discuss what happened in the meeting with Cadence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-02-2016, 11:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T14:55:40-07:00","id":942248,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> Spider smiles at her compainion, nodding a farewell to Melody as they move to leave.<span style=\"color:#0000FF\"> &quot;Samoas?</span>&quot; She asks hopefully. &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">And, we'll make sure she's okay and pick up the documents Mel. Be back before you know it.</span>&quot; She smiles warmly at Ouroboros Ophis,, padding along at his side. &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">The afternoon should be a good time to.. after her daughter's out of school.&quot;</span> Spider checks her phone as it beeps, then smiles. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Speak of the devils.. perhaps we should invite them to lunch too. They're looking to talk. And we could manage to cover quite a bit more ground that way.&quot;</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T05:53:08-07:00","id":942657,"title":"","content":"<b>Everyone (same scene)</b><br /> After your respective meetings end, with your mentors waving goodbye and encouraging you to contact them with any questions or concerns, you agree to meet for lunch early in the afternoon at a restaurant you've used as a meeting place before. You each have a few hours for errands, preparation, or teaching obligations, and then you make your way to the restaurant on the west side of the city. It's a nice deli and caf\u00e9 with just enough background noise and music playing, and tables just far enough apart, that you can have private conversations without necessarily looking like you're hiding something. The food is pretty great, too.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You each have 2 hours between your earlier meetings and this one. If there is something specific you'd like to do during that time, please indicate it in your post. Otherwise, I'll assume you spend it doing miscellaneous things like reading, talking to colleagues, etc.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T14:56:19-07:00","id":943021,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Marvin Bates (Dr. Bates for his patients and students, just Marv for his wife) left Melody's office and, after taking note of the place and hour of their cabal's afternoon meeting, said goodbye to the young woman (still a girl in Marvin's eyes) wich he came to asociate with the name <i>Spider</i>.<br /> <br /> As he left both women behind and walked the corridors and open spaces of the campus back to his class, he left that part of himself behind too. The one he called Ouroboros Ophis. As a snake shed its skin, so did he shed that name and identity, the only part of his life he could not (should not!) share with his wife, and became just Dr. Bates. No small deal of shame and regret was mixed with the joy that magic brought to his life.<br /> <br /> He not only had, actual, factual, proof that shuch a thing as the <i>soul</i> existed, he was in a privileged position to study it. He saw. He. Saw. He could not help it. He took any chemical product in his lab and new all its properties and aplications even before glacing at them. He now knew the secret mudras and mantras that would repair broken bones, stop bleeding, mend flesh and prevent or banish infection and disease away. Yes, a veritable world of wonder.<br /> <br /> And yet...<br /> <br /> And yet the man that called himself Dr Bates, or Marvin, or just Marv, was not (could not!) be completely happy. Because it was a part of his life he should (have to!) keep away from his other half. His wife, Melissa.<br /> <br /> With a long, tired, sigh, he left Ouroboros Ophis behind him, with Spider and Melody. Like a discarded skin, dry, crumbling.<br /> <br /> At least for a couple of hours he would just be the man his wife knew, and nothing more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T15:02:23-07:00","id":943022,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Dr Luck asks Simurgh if he needs a ride anywhere before driving home and preparing for a cabal meeting two hours from now. Once Dr Luck gets home he clears a place in his small living room for an instant spellcasting. He begins forming an Imago in his mind. He uses advanced techniques to make the spell last a day with a push of power and skill. He uses another advanced technique to cast the spell in an instant. He wraps himself in the Imago of luck and fortune, and thus modifies the Imago. Dr Luck would be Charmed for an entire day. Good things would happen to him. He then begins to weave another blessing into another Imago. He weaves himself being Steadfast into the Imago. Then he weaves a general luck sequence into the Imago, and proceeds to cast the spells.<br /> <br /> When the two hours are up Dr Luck goes to the cafe.<br /> <br /> OOC<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Dr Luck will cast exceptional luck as a Praxis. He will cast the spell twice, once for charmed and once for steadfast.<br /> Gnosis 3 + Fate 3 + High Speech 2 + Dedicated tool(walking cane) 1 - advanced duration (One reach) One day -2 = 7 dice for charmed (one reach for instant cast), Primary Spell Factor is Potency, at Fate 3, gives Potency 3, adds one potency for default and 2 more because of primary spell factor, 1 + 2<br /> One potency is used for charmed, the other 2 are for 9 again rolls.<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423996\" target=\"_blank\">Charmed</a>: <u>7d10o10h8</u> <b>4</b><br /> Same mechanics for Steadfast<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/423998\" target=\"_blank\">Steadfast</a>: <u>7d10o10h8</u> <b>2</b><br /> On the exceptional success for charmed, I would like to use the additional potency I got and use it for the 9 again roll non spellcasting. This should leave me with Charmed and 3 rolls of 9 again.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-04-2016, 10:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T23:30:44-07:00","id":943443,"title":"","content":"[SIZE=14px]<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> While she holds on her Cabal mates to gather and the Machine to return from its brief scouting, Root decides to take her own preparations, just in case they should be needed. The young woman has some jobs on the go that weren't magic related, but for today,,her duties to the Free Council came first.<br /> <br /> Which is how she cam to be kneeling in a circle made of copper wire, hands on her knees as she mediated and fell into the needed trance for ritual casting.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <i>Wards and Signs</i> (Prime 2)<br /> 1 Free Reach; Spending for advanced duration.<br /> Base pool of 3. +1 (Dedicated tool) +2 (High Speech), 3 successes <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/424145\" target=\"_blank\">http://orokos.com/roll/424145</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T11:42:34-07:00","id":943749,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:green\"><b>Simurgh</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Shadow Walk: duration until late morning 10 September 2016, CW +2 (5)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> Simurg declines Luck's offer and drives home to fetch Rebounds in bottle, then drives to the meeting place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T08:19:17-07:00","id":946177,"title":"","content":"<b>Ouroboros Ophis</b><br /> Although you regret leaving the magical world behind you, you find solace in teaching. This is something you value, and although you feel the temptation to focus on magical rather than mundane methods of medical instruction, you find yourself enjoying your lecture. Several students stay after class to ask you follow-up questions and thank you for your dedication to their education. It makes you a little late to the meeting, but you still beat Spider there.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Luck</b><br /> You cast your spell and prepare yourself for any possible threats you might encounter today. After all, you have learned all too well that sometimes divinations can change, especially when others manipulate time or threads of fate.<br /> <br /> Your return ride to the restaurant is remarkably pleasant. You happen to time the traffic lights <i>just</i> right, allowing you to beat most of the traffic. Someone pulls out of the perfect parking spot as you pull into the parking lot across the street from the restaurant.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">As mentioned in the OOC thread, you can't stack Exceptional Luck multiple times, but you can mix and match the potency effect (4 in this case, due to your exceptional success and advancing the primary spell factor). You gain Charmed, Steadfast, and 2 uses of 9-again that you can apply to mundane rolls in the next 24 hours or until the spell ends.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Spider</b><br /> After your meeting with Melody and Ophis, you take a moment to &quot;speak&quot; with The Machine. Although you lack any control over the Spirit Arcanum, Melody has guided you on ideas for how to use technology to convey messages to The Machine. You've learned that your familiar can &quot;hear&quot; your words through the device you wear in your ear, at least when it is in your immediate surroundings, or other technology nearby. Usually you find yourself typing into a word processor software, on which The Machine can also communicate basic ideas. It has also learned to communicate with you by passing &quot;sounds&quot; through the earpiece.<br /> <br /> You ask The Machine to scout Jill's address. You make sure to do this hours in advance, because The Machine does not always like to do exactly as you ask -- and her home is still several miles west of you. You occasionally shift your senses and <i>see</i> through The Machine's &quot;eyes&quot; as it drifts west in Twilight Form. Occasionally, it pauses to siphon energy from weaker spirits, and it stops for a while at a computer repair shop where an IT technician is trying to fix a busted hard drive on someone's laptop.<br /> <br /> Confident that The Machine will eventually accomplish the task on which you sent it, you turn your attention to your ritual. You weave Prime magic around yourself, creating a tight shield that will repel or unravel weaker spells attempting to touch you. You glance at your watch and realize you're an hour late for the cabal meeting, so you head to the meeting location as quickly as possible.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You may make a Wits + Composure roll to look through the familiar's senses whenever you like as a reflexive action.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Simurgh</b><br /> Like a pet happy to see its master return home, Rebounds-on-Ground hops up to you when it sees you. You feel a sense of eagerness as it jumps into the bottle and ribbits quietly as you stow the bottle in your pocket, safely away from the sunlight. You're one of the first to arrive to the restaurant. Eventually, the rest of your cabal gathers to discuss the information your respective mentors have shared with you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":".  Fixed post for Dr. Luck 08-08-2016, 02:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-08T14:09:59-07:00","id":946443,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> <br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 13/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 <br /> <b>Conditions:</b>Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> Dr Luck parks his 60's volkswagon in the parking spot just across the street from the restaraunt that was to be the cabals meeting place. He looks around for a table and spots an empty one. He sits down there. He greets each of the members of the cabal when they arrive. Before that. however, he orders his meal. He orders a hot pastrami on rye with saute'ed onions and peppers. To drink he orders a heineken and for desert a slice of cinnamon peach pie. He waits for his order to be delivered.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;There are two things I would like to address today. The first is the issue of us helping our mentors. The question I have is how should we prepare. I can bless us all with good fortune. I can grant exceptional luck and general blessings to help us to achieve our goals. I can also try to give each of you the ability to see a particular future of an action you undertake and allow you to choose which future you want to occur. If you can think of something else you would feel appropriate to a situation like this, please speak up. What preparations can you all add to the endeavor.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The other thing that I would like to address is how we can come together as a cabal and increase our potential. Simurgh brought the issue up to me and I would like to sort this out together. Our mentors, Melody and Cadence work in a cabal that is known as the Band. They are synced together and enjoy the benefits of that syncronization. This is done by sycronizing our shadow names. I spoke to Cadence briefly and he said that quite possibly two of us would need to adopt new shadow names. I would be willing to change my name for the group.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck eats his meal as he listens to his cabal mates.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T08:32:50-07:00","id":946960,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> Marvin Bates took a look at his pocket watch after the last student left him alone in the classroom. &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Oh, look what time it is!</span>&quot; He quickly went to his office to leave everything arranged for next day. He made a short call to his wife, informing her of the lunch meeting, without entering into too much detail and drove to the restaurant. Despite the hour he did not hurry, Marvin was nothing if a prudent and law-abiding citizen, better arrive late tahn never, that was what his parents tought him. It took him a little while once there to find a parking place, all the good ones were taken, as expected. He did not despair and, after a couple of turns found a place.<br /> <br /> He entered the restaurant and took a look inside until he recognized so called Dr. Luck's face among the crowded place. The young novelist seemed to have already ordered. Notably absent, though, was Spider.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Evening, son</span>&quot; he greeted the younger mage before taking his jacket off and sitting down with him. As soon as a waiter aproaches, he orders a simple Cesar salad and a bottle of mineral water. &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">So, I am guessing your Mentor also asked you to go looking for this lady, Jill McCann? I do not know what to expect of this. It seems rutinary enough, but in this particular line of work I am not sure that equates <i>safe</i></span>&quot; He took a sip of water. &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>If</i>, it is a ghost who is causing trouble, I may be of some help, otherwise we might have to rely on the expertise of our good man, Simurgh</span>&quot; he ate some of his salad and took a time to savour it before adressing the other point. &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Cabal syncronization? Interesting concept. I did realize the curious coincidence of three of us having animal names, but did not ponder it much. I am sure, though, that same as any of us you had a personal reason for choosing that name, and that name only, Dr. Luck. I would not agree to you changing your name, unless it is on your own free will and for another that you feel, <i>really feel </i>that resonates with you on a deep, personal level</span>&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 08-09-2016, 11:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T06:11:47-07:00","id":947713,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Wards and Signs<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> Spider hurries in, adjusting the laptop slung over her back. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Late. Hope I'm not too late.&quot; </span>She panted a little, looking between them and slipping into a seat. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;So, er, what did I miss? Names, and the visit to Jill? Sent the Machine on ahead, just to take a look, just in case. I'll see if it figures anything out. And, um, I can do a lot against any physical problems, but spirits, ghosts, they're not my forte.</span>&quot; She smiles ruefully. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I'm here as tech support, sort of. And, hey, if you want to change your name, it's your call. But we shouldn't bury you in peer pressure or anything.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2650,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","user":"Retias","date":". 08-10-2016, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T08:10:22-07:00","id":947786,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b><br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 11/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Dr Luck eats the hot pastrami on rye when the food comes in and he smiles as he enjoys his food. He takes his time and savors each morsel of food. He watches as Ouroboros eats his Ceaser salad.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;This is great food. How is your salad?&quot;</span> Dr Luck asks.<br /> <br /> After a while he notices that Spider is late. He makes small talk with Ouroboros and Simurgh as they wait for their tardy cabal mate. When Spider gets there and joins the conversation, Dr Luck asks the group of them,<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;Can you think of any prep spells that you can cast on all of us. I would like to bless you all with exceptional luck. I just have to cast it and touch each of you. Is there any prep spell you can cast on all of us that may help us with spirits or ghosts?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck listens to each of the replies. He nods at things he considers useful.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;When are we going to the house, tonight or right now? If now, lets all go to my car for a little privacy and I can cast the blessing on you. Of course if you don't want the blessing, that is fine too.&quot;</span><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> This spell is cast as praxis.<br /> Cast a days worth of exceptional luck on each cabal mate,<br /> Ouroboros Fate 3 + Gnosis 3 + Dedicated Tool 1 + High Speech 2 = 9<br /> Spell potency 1 + 2 on the potency chart = 3<br /> 1 Reach instant spell casting<br /> 1 Reach advanced duration -2 for 1 day<br /> 1 Reach advanced area of affect<br /> 9 -2 = 7 Dice<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/425822\" target=\"_blank\">Exceptional Luck</a>: <u>7d10o10h8</u> <b>3<br /> Spend 2 mana to mitigate paradox<br /> exceptional success for potency 4</b><br /> The condition granted is charmed and steadfast and two 9 again mundane roll<br /> Got willpower back for exceptional success<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-10-2016, 07:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T09:53:59-07:00","id":948657,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Luck</b><br /> You cast your luck charm with grace, tapping into your inner well of mana to help mitigate the risk of Paradox.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The spell still technically risks Paradox because you're overreaching, but because you mitigate by 2, it's reduced to a chance roll. <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/426048\" target=\"_blank\">Paradox (chance roll)</a>: 0 successes.<br /> <br /> Weren't you already at full WP? You can give yourself 1 mana back instead, per the rules on exceptional spellcasting rolls. (I believe that you don't get both points back because those were spent on mitigating Paradox, not technically the casting of the spell itself.)<br /> <br /> As noted, you all gain Charmed, Steadfast, and 2 uses of 9-again on mundane rolls for the rest of the spell's duration, until the boons are used.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T11:00:22-07:00","id":948696,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:green\"><b>Simurgh</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Shadow Walk: duration until late morning 10 September 2016, CW +2 (5); Ephemeral Shield: duration until afternoon 10 Oktober 2016, CW +4 (7)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>/</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 3/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;So it's settled, then. Unless we can contrive Luck as a zookeeper or something, no theme for us.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;Can you think of any prep spells that you can cast on all of us. I would like to bless you all with exceptional luck. I just have to cast it and touch each of you. Is there any prep spell you can cast on all of us that may help us with spirits or ghosts?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;Luck sounds nice. I can help too. I could make us harder to notice, or, what I gather would be more useful, harder to harm or mind control.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He waits for the replies, too.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;When are we going to the house, tonight or right now? If now, lets all go to my car for a little privacy and I can cast the blessing on you. Of course if you don't want the blessing, that is fine too.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">&quot;I'd rather we go now.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Ephemeral Shield<br /> This spell is cast as a rote.<br /> Gnosis 1 + Spirit 2 + Stealth 2 + High Speech 2 + WP 3 - factors 4 = 6d10h8o10<br /> 5 free Reaches, spent on Advanced Potency, Advanced Duration, Instant Casting , Advanced Scale, physical protection<br /> Potency 1 (+1 to CW), Duration one Month (4), Scale up to 5 targets (1): whoever of the cabalmates agrees<br /> Containing Paradox<br /> Paradox: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/426560\" target=\"_blank\">1 success</a><br /> Containing: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/426561\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a><br /> Casting: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/426054\" target=\"_blank\">4 successes</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":6508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","user":"Tambov","date":". 08-13-2016, 07:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T14:36:40-07:00","id":948858,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Exceptional Luck, Ephemeral Shield (Potency 1, 1 Month), Body Control (Potency 3, 1 Week)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>5/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>Charmed, Steadfast, 2x(9-Again) | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">The salad is delicious, thanks for asking son</span>&quot; He feels the rush of magic as a gentle shiver coursing his body &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Thanks for that blessing too, I am sure it will come in handy</span>&quot; He says to the young writer.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Well, as for the Cabal theme, maybe we can aproach it from another perspective. He thinks for a moment. &quot;From the top of my head, things tha come in fours and have metaphisical significance...elements, perhaps? It may be possible for each of us to associate with one on top of our Shadow Name</span>&quot; He strokes his beard, thinking &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Ok, what about this: luck can be said to be fluid like <i><b>Water</b></i> and fickle like the sea, Spider's Web is an invisible one of data and information going trough the<b><i> Air</i></b>, a Simurgh has a lot in common with a phoenix in some texts, so that gives us <i><b>Fire</b></i>. Finally, a snake is a common cthonic symbol, so that would be <i><b>Earth</b></i></span>&quot;<br /> <br /> He waits for his cabalmates opinions.<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">As for preventive magic, I know a very useful spell that could grant us several advantages. On top of Dr. Luck's blessing and Simurgh's protection it should be enough for a start. I need to make contact with all of you to work it</span>&quot; He waits till all them touch him and starts mumbling a Mantra in High Speech while making complicated hand Mudras.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Casting <b>Body Control</b> as a Rote. 4 Free Reach: Instant Casting (1), Optional healing Lethal damage (2), Extended Duration (1). Yantras: Mantras (High Speech +2) Mudras (+4 Medicine Rote Specialty). Willpower (+3)<br /> <b>Dice Pool</b>: Gnosis 1 + Life 3 + Yantras 6 + Willpower 3 = <b>13</b> -4 (Scale: 4 targets) -4 (Potency: 3) -0 (Duration: 1 Week) <b>5 dice: </b><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/426113\" target=\"_blank\">2 Successes!</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":195,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","user":"Thorbes","date":". 08-11-2016, 05:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T16:27:26-07:00","id":948922,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b>Exceptional Luck, Ephemeral Shield (Potency 1, 1 Month), Body Control (Potency 3, 1 Week)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 11/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I think that we are pretty much ready to handle any challenge that comes from a ghost or spirit or practical joker. I see this going pretty well. We are pretty much going to leave and do this now, Simurgh is ready, as am I, I presume Ouroboros is ready, and if it's ok with Spider, we can leave now.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck will pause for a second while he considers Ouroboros's metaphysical elements idea. As Ouroboros speaks Dr Luck nods and smiles.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;Now that is a brilliant idea. Cadence from the Mysterium told me about an old manuscript that could shine light on the subject.That should help us put your idea into focus. Once we are done with this errand I will see about getting the manuscript or a copy. I think that this is turning around very well. If we can do this we can all keep our favored names. Dr Luck and water, brilliant.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck turns to Simurgh,<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;Never give up. If you can't do something, find another way to go. If there is no other way to go, create a way. Learn how to create a path to your goal, and then work that path until you win. The ultimate success formula is know what you want, know what to do to get it, and do it. If you fail, research another way or create another way. Never give up, just do something else.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Dr Luck finishes his meal and pays his tab. He leaves a generous tip. He makes his way back to his old volkswagon, gets in, and prays it turns on. To no one in particular he says,<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;I really wish that I had gotten if not a new car from my Advancement from my book and not this house. Well I do like this place.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> He goes to where the group decides to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-12-2016, 11:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T00:40:14-07:00","id":949924,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Wards and Signs<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;I do like the sound of that.&quot; </span>Spider muses with a smile. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;The classical elements are so very mage like, in a traditional sense. If that's something to tap into, then it has my vote. And, I'm ready to go now, yes. I'll see what the Machine can tell us on the way. And, let's be ready for anything out here? Could be spirits, ghosts, furries. I sort of want to meet one one day, must be interesting creatures, but.. they're meant to have really bad tempers.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Understatement.<br /> <br /> She hastily finishes her drink and stands with a nod.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T10:19:57-07:00","id":950122,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:green\"><b>Simurgh</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Shadow Walk: duration until late morning 10 September 2016, CW +2 (5); Ephemeral Shield: duration until afternoon 10 Oktober 2016, CW +4 (7)<br /> <b>Health:</b> <b>/</b>OOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 3/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> Simurgh chuckles.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well... I'd say it's funny that the opposite elements share their Order, but it works. Anybody has an idea for a cabal name? Elemantal Menagerie?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T11:56:09-07:00","id":951225,"title":"","content":"<b>Everyone</b><br /> You all finish your meals and conversation, and then find a place outside to have slightly more privacy for casting your defensive spells on each other.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> OOC: I'm going to assume that you at least try to avoid casting your mudra-based spells inside. You've been introduced at the Consilium at this point, and it was strongly recommended that you do not cast spells in public except under appropriate situations -- i.e., when in serious danger or being very subtle. </div> </div> </div> <b>Spider</b><br /> Just before leaving the caf\u00e9, you shift your senses over to see through The Machine's eyes.<br /> <br /> Distantly, you sense calculated disappointment through your bond with The Machine. Your familiar is focusing its attention on a house located in the neighborhood that matches the address Melody gave you. The spirit is floating around a desktop computer in an office, but the computer is off. So are the monitor, speakers, and small box fan adjacent to the computer desk. Through its &quot;eyes,&quot; all over the floor you see papers lying scattered around, which ruffle from a breeze through a nearby open window.<br /> <br /> As The Machine turns around, still trying and failing to connect to the technology, you see the lower half of a person lying on the floor at the end of the hallway leading to the office. Only the legs are visible from this angle. There is a pool of dark red liquid next to the legs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T23:35:17-07:00","id":951521,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><b>Spider</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Wards and Signs<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 4/5 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions:</b> None <b>Tilts:</b> None</div><br /> Spider freezes, her eyes growing wide.<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&quot;Ouroboros..&quot;</span> She shudders, then spins, focusing on the others. &quot;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">We need to go. We need to get there right the fuck now.&quot;</span> Without another wordor comment to explan her sudden reaction, She turns again, making a direct run for the car. Jill or her daughter? Neither was good, but she really hoped it wasn't her daughter..<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><i>Will fix the computer. </i></span>She thought desperately at the Machine. <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><i>Can you show me the corridor?</i></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T01:50:01-07:00","id":951559,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Periphereal Sight </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Supress Aura (Potency 1, 1 day Duration)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 10/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>None | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">You heard the miss, we have to go</span>&quot; accustomed to sudden emergencies, he understood the tone of Spider. She didn't have to explain anything, he knew one or maybe both of the women they needed to meet with was badly injured. The sooner they got there, the better chances they had to save their lives, if that was still a posibility. He certainly hoped so. He went into his car, a small doctor's bag with general supplies always there for this very reason. That and his coat, his symbol of office and Dedicated Tool. They all should come in handy soon enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T11:11:07-07:00","id":951849,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Exceptional Luck, Ephemeral Shield (Potency 1, 1 Month), Body Control (Potency 3, 1 Week)<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 11/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> Dr Luck knows something must be up with the family they were charged to investigate. He rushes to his beat up old volkswagon and jumps in. He, and his entire cabal make good use of exceptional luck to get to the house in question as quick as possible. Dr Luck speeds. He goes at speeds upward of one hundred fifty miles per hour. He trusts luck to keep him safe as he rushes to the house. When he arrives he hopes to see a parking spot next to the house or in front of it.<br /> <br /> His ride there is hopefully charmed. He makes all the lights and is not pulled over by the police. When he arrives at the house he rushes in. The first thing he does is casts an improvised Fate spell. It looks worse than it actually is. He tries to downgrade what he will find in the house.<br /> <br /> OOC<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Both spells are improvised<br /> <br /> Not to die in a car accident. He does not use his dedicated tool because he is driving.<br /> Gnosis 3 + Fate 3 + High Speech 2 = 8 Dice<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427317\" target=\"_blank\">Get to House Safely</a>: <u>8d10o10h8</u> <b>2</b><br /> <br /> Make Jill or her daughters wounds less damaging than they originally appear.<br /> Gnosis 3 + Fate 3 + High Speech 2 + Dedicated Tool 1 = 9 Dice.<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427318\" target=\"_blank\">Make wounds less damaging</a>: <u>9d10o10h8</u> <b>3</b><br /> <br /> He casts a spell to make the damage less than it first seems. If necessary he will close out exceptional luck to reduce the damage to one wound level.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-16-2016, 07:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T07:19:14-07:00","id":952493,"title":"","content":"<b>Spider</b><br /> You send a sense of urgency through your empathic bond with the Machine. As you continue to see through its &quot;eyes,&quot; the Machine sends a feeling of minor annoyance and disappointment, but slowly moves away from the computer to head down the corridor.<br /> <br /> From the end of the hallway, the spirit looks upon a grim scene. The legs belong to a woman, not a child, probably in her late 30s. It's hard to recognize many of her features because of the condition of her body. Large gashes extend across her arms, torso, and upper legs. She is resting in a pool of blood at an awkward angle, because her shoulder or back are likely snapped. Her mouth is slack-jawed, eyes staring at the ceiling. She is not breathing.<br /> <br /> The Machine moves forward to investigate her right hand, where she is holding her phone. This device is on, and you can sense the Machine's mild pleasure as it studies the phone with curiously.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I don't see any rules in the MtAw 2E book about how communication with your familiar works, at least in terms of your ability to make requests at a distance. I do like the idea of an empathic bond, so you can feel its emotion and send your own emotions out. Over time, you and your familiar will grow to understand each other better, improving the quality of that communication, but it won't always obey your requests or respond as you want. Developing expertise with Spirit magic will make that easier, but won't be strictly necessary. Does that sound fair?</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Dr. Luck</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Ok, a few things about your post here.<br /> <br /> First, from my reading of Fate spells and how that magic works, even the stronger Fate spells don't just automatically let you do what you want. They influence chance so much that it can <i>seem</i> like you can do whatever you want, but at your current mastery of that Arcanum you can't create your own fate. Make sure you give me a chance as the Storyteller to tell you what happens in response to your spells and actions. Because you could use Fate 3 to pretty easily give yourself the rote quality on any mundane roll you want, including driving, I'll skip the roll in this case. But especially since you don't have training in Drive, your car is poor quality, and you're in a big hurry, there could be a potential chance for something to go wrong, even with the rote quality on that roll.<br /> <br /> Second, you can't use your Charmed condition from Exceptional Luck to reduce someone else's damage, only your own. You're the one Charmed, not them. In addition, Fate magic really can only be used to affect present or future actions; interacting with something from the past requires Time magic. To undo, prevent, or mitigate the effects of what you're about to see, you would need more than the Ruling practice of Time.<br /> <br /> Third, because you're driving in a different vehicle than most of the others (I think a lot of you arrived separately), you won't be able to affect them with your magic or offer boons unless you can cast on them sympathetically or at sensory range. They could use their 9-again or Charmed boons to affect their own rolls, but I don't think anyone has done that yet.<br /> <br /> Does this make sense? I'm trying to be fair and allow you to be awesome (I think mages should be able to feel awesome), but still staying within the rules.<br /> <br /> On an unrelated note, don't forget that spells cast on you by someone else do not affect your own spell control in 2nd edition. You have Ephemeral Shield and Body Control listed under your active spells, but you're not in control of those, so no need to use Reach to cast additional spells because you're not at your spell limit yet.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> With a lot of luck, you're able to turn your beat-up Volkswagen into a veritable racing car. The fact that the poor vehicle survives the drive is a testament to your burgeoning mastery of Fate.<br /> <br /> You speed down the road, manage to catch all of the lights at exactly the right time -- and just as you reach each intersection, the car in front of you makes a turn or switches lanes, clearing your way through the intersection at breakneck speeds. You don't pass any cops along the way, thankfully. And the road you take only has one camera-enforced speed limit, but when it tries to take your picture, a bird flies just in front of the camera, blocking its view. You <i>do</i> get a lot of yells and rude gestures hurled your way by other drivers, but thankfully no one is injured in the process.<br /> <br /> You arrive at the McCann residence several minutes before the rest of your cabal, a noteworthy feat considering that the drive usually only takes 10 or 15 minutes at most from the caf\u00e9. The modest house is located in a quiet countryside subdivision, with only a few other houses on the street distantly visible from the driveway. No other cars are parked here. The garage and front door appear to be closed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":8136,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","user":"rwknoll","date":". 08-17-2016, 10:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T15:44:47-07:00","id":952795,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Exceptional Luck<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 11/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> When Dr Luck arrives he leaps from his car and races to the front door. Hopefully it is not locked when he twists the knob to let himself in. If it is locked he tries a window. He gets into the house as quickly as possible and does a quick search of the house.<br /> <br /> Should he find the body the first thing he does is cast an improvised spell designed to keep her alive until Ouroboros gets here. His goal is to keep her alive at all costs. This is what he is concentrating on.<br /> <br /> After he casts the spell he applies mouth to mouth and heart presses. He next touches the silver head of his walking stick, his dedicated tool to her chest. He uses high speech to describe her staying alive. He puts one hand on the other and presses her chest. He does not want her to die. Part of the spell is the mouth to mouth and heart presses, hopefully he is lucky that he catches her just before she dies and keeps her alive until Ouroboros gets here.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> First thanks for bearing with me on the last post.<br /> improvised spell. Goal- Keep this woman alive until someone who knows what he is doing gets there. He luckily does everything just right to keep her alive, all based on research he did for medical scenes in his first book. The blockbuster novel.<br /> Gnosis 3 + Fate 3 + High Speech 2 + Dedicated Tool 1 = 9 Dice<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427676\" target=\"_blank\">Keep woman alive improvised spell, 9 again</a>: <u>9d10o9h8</u> <b>7</b><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-17-2016, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T07:34:14-07:00","id":953160,"title":"","content":"<b>Dr. Luck</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I know we're not currently in initiative, but can you try to keep your posts to one or two actions at a time and then let me respond to give you more information? Otherwise, you can write posts like this one and start rolling for actions that may not end up happening. Casting a few spells in a row when you're not in combat is generally fine, because you're not in a time crunch, but some of the actions you're describing (e.g., examining the woman's body) may or may not be possible depending on the results of a previous action (getting into the house).<br /> <br /> If you were trying to break into a mage's sanctum, for example, you can't just list all of your actions in order and safely assume they'll go off without a hitch. Unexpected defenses can cause a lot of grief for you.<br /> <br /> Also, just wanted to repeat what I said earlier about how Fate magic works. It can make your mundane actions rolls incredibly likely to succeed, but you still need some kind of action -- you can't make just anything happen by making a spell casting roll, at least not at your current Arcana mastery or with Fate magic. Just because there is a degree of chance to many actions doesn't mean that those actions themselves are directly under the Fate Arcanum's purview.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> You try to open the front door, but it's bolted shut. Walking around the building reveals that the garage door is closed with no apparent mechanism for unlocking it from outside, and no other unlocked doors.<br /> <br /> You do notice one window partially open. You have to stand on your tiptoes to reach it, but you're able to grab the ledge and pull yourself up and through the window. You find yourself in an office. There's a computer, printer, and small box fan resting on a desk next to a gently used chair. None of them appear to be on. Although the room generally looks well organized and tidy, there are papers scattered all over the floor. There's also a shattered picture frame lying facedown on the ground next to a bookshelf.<br /> <br /> Down the hallway, you see part of a body lying in the floor in a pool of blood. Moving down the corridor reveals a grisly scene, with a woman in her late 30s lying at an awkward angle. She appears heavily lacerated and does not seem to be breathing.<br /> <br /> You frantically weave your will into a Fate spell, trying to use CPR at the precisely proper timing, pushing with just the right strength, willing luck to comply with your desperate desire to ensure the woman's health and safety. You know from your research on the subject for your book that only a portion of people survive from CPR; you try to draw on Fate magic to make sure that she beats the odds.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You may make a Wits + Medicine roll to assess her current condition. Because you have no training in Medicine, you're at -3 on the roll. This brings you to a chance die unless you adjust the roll, such as through spending WP. You can gain 1 mana due to your exceptional success on the spellcasting roll, since you already have the other relevant conditions and full WP. Alternatively, you can spend WP on the requested roll and then get the WP back for free.<br /> <br /> In the time it would take you to search around the house, get inside, and attempt CPR, the other PCs can arrive.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>My Games</b><br /> Mage 2E: The Supernal Suburbia (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/929924-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a> / <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/920977-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-the-supernal-suburbia\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>) - Storyteller","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8136-rwknoll","name":"rwknoll","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"785"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T11:22:34-07:00","id":953309,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"color:red\"><b>Dr Luck</b></span></span></span><br /> <b>Peripheral Sight</b> | <b>Active Spell(s):</b> Exceptional Luck<br /> <b>Health:</b> OOOOOOO | <b>WP:</b> 6/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 11/13 | <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Conditions:</b>Charmed, Steadfast | <b>Tilts:</b> None</div> <br /> <br /> Dr Luck does not see what he thinks of as improvement in the woman. He starts sweating from the excertion. What can he do to save this woman? He does not want to lose. He will not lose. He will keep this woman alive until his cabal gets to her.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:blue\">&quot;Don't you die on me, I won't have it!&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Then he remembers a Time powered spell. He doesn't remember it perfectly but he could at least try it.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> 1 Reach instant spell casting<br /> 1 reach naturally heal<br /> Gnosis 3 + Time 2 + High Speech 2 + Dedicated Tool 1 + Willpower 3 = 11 dice 9 again roll<br /> <br /> First Try <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427914\" target=\"_blank\">Veil Of Moments 9 again</a>: <u>9d10o9h8</u> <b>0 No 9 again mistake</b><br /> <br /> Second Try<br /> <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427915\" target=\"_blank\">Veil Of Moments 9 again</a>: <u>11d10o9h8</u> <b>6 No9 againmistake<br /> <br /> No 9 again spell casting roll </b><a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll/427917\" target=\"_blank\">Veil Of Moments</a>: <u>11d10o10h8</u> <b>7</b><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> When he hears cars stop outside he runs to the door to let in his cabal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","user":"wtaylorjr2001","date":". 08-18-2016, 02:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T02:51:57-07:00","id":953729,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ouroboros Ophis</span></span><br /> Active Sight (Death, Life, Matter) </b>| <b>Active Spells: </b>Exceptional Luck, Ephemeral Shield (Potency 1, 1 Month), Body Control (Potency 3, 1 Week)<br /> <b>Health: </b>OOOOOO | <b>WP: </b>5/6 | <b>Mana:</b> 9/10 | <b>Wisdom: </b>7 (Understanding)<br /> <b>Conditions: </b>Charmed, Steadfast, 2x(9-Again) | <b>Tilts: </b>None</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">What is the situation?</span>&quot; the doctor asked his cabalmate entering the house &quot;<span style=\"color:#008000\">Still alive?</span>&quot; He took his coat and bag and went directly to the room where the woman lay still on the floor in a pool of what appeared to be her own blood. Without wasting a moment he opened his Sight, directing the flow of Mana to his eyes to benefit from his expertise in the Mysteries of Life.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 